,"text":"どうしてなのか、あの時は深く考えなかったけど…今なら分かる気がする。","nextNodeIds":[761230153]},{"nodeId":761230153,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3220596458,"text":"料理には、作った人の心が込められてるでしょ。","nextNodeIds":[761230154]},{"nodeId":761230154,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":491559914,"text":"それをいただくってことは、作ってくれた人の温かさや優しさも身体に取り入れること。","nextNodeIds":[761230155]},{"nodeId":761230155,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1024818194,"text":"見返りを求められないからこそ、心から愛おしいって思えるし、同じ気持ちでしか返せないんだと思う。","nextNodeIds":[761230156]},{"nodeId":761230156,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4051503114,"text":"なんだか照れちゃうな。あのときは、おまえの機嫌を取りたいって気持ちがちょっとだけあったけどな。","nextNodeIds":[761230157,761230158]},{"nodeId":761230157,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3127134314,"text":"でも、今は違うよ。","nextNodeIds":[761230159]},{"nodeId":761230159,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":336071146,"text":"うん。でも、私も友達のために何かしてあげたい…とても幸せな気持ちになるから。","nextNodeIds":[761230160]},{"nodeId":761230160,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1073475178,"text":"クルムカケを届けに行くけど、付き合ってくれる？","nextNodeIds":[761230161]},{"nodeId":761230161,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1911524370,"text":"ほかにもちょっとしたプレゼントを用意したの。あ、でも、気づかれないように届けるよ。","nextNodeIds":[761230162]},{"nodeId":761230162,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":243709818,"text":"なんでだ？","nextNodeIds":[761230163]},{"nodeId":761230163,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":4286969034,"text":"みんながやってくれてたみたいに、私も「サプライズ」をしてみたいの。受け取ったときの反応も見てみたい。","nextNodeIds":[761230164]},{"nodeId":761230164,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2748946722,"text":"ふぅ、これで配達完了だよな？","nextNodeIds":[761230165]},{"nodeId":761230165,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":590514538,"text":"みんなの反応も面白かったな。コロンビーナからのプレゼントだって全く気づいてないやつもいたけど。","nextNodeIds":[761230166]},{"nodeId":761230166,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2657925946,"text":"アイノは夢中で食べてたね…","nextNodeIds":[761230167]},{"nodeId":761230167,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":190040850,"text":"想定内の反応だったし、全然気にしてないよ。みんなが喜んでくれればそれでいいの。","nextNodeIds":[761230168]},{"nodeId":761230168,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3522925834,"text":"でも、ラウマはテーブルに置かれたクルムカケと花輪を見て、コロンビーナからだって気づいたみたいだったぜ。","nextNodeIds":[761230169]},{"nodeId":761230169,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1276987722,"text":"花輪はともかく…食べるのがもったいなくて、クルムカケを十分間も見つめてたのには、さすがに呆れたけどな。","nextNodeIds":[761230170]},{"nodeId":761230170,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":384828234,"text":"お供えするかと思っちゃった…","nextNodeIds":[761230171]},{"nodeId":761230171,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3185132770,"text":"でも、ヤフォダを驚かせちゃったね…こっそり後ろに置いたのがよくなかったかも…","nextNodeIds":[761230172]},{"nodeId":761230172,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2065359578,"text":"飛び上がってたもんね…","nextNodeIds":[761230173]},{"nodeId":761230173,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4120680466,"text":"ヤフォダはもともと警戒心が強いからな。でも、アシュルが爪とぎに気づいて、かきかきしてるのを見て、ほっとしたみたいだった。","nextNodeIds":[761230174]},{"nodeId":761230174,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2644044378,"text":"ナド・クライにいない人の分は、お願いね。","nextNodeIds":[761230175]},{"nodeId":761230175,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15738,"speakerName":"長羽トキ","textMapHash":1312244098,"text":"！！","nextNodeIds":[761230176]},{"nodeId":761230176,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1623449338,"text":"きっとみんな喜ぶと思うぞ。","nextNodeIds":[761230177]},{"nodeId":761230177,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":491966754,"text":"はい、どうぞ。","nextNodeIds":[761230178]},{"nodeId":761230178,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2259294130,"text":"おっ！オイラたちの分もあるのか？","nextNodeIds":[761230179]},{"nodeId":761230179,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4351650,"text":"キャンディ？みんなと同じクルムカケじゃないのか？","nextNodeIds":[761230180]},{"nodeId":761230180,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1863060314,"text":"クルムカケは試食のときに食べたから、違うものがいいかなと思って。","nextNodeIds":[761230181,761230182]},{"nodeId":761230181,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":738628386,"text":"うん、おいしい。","nextNodeIds":[761230183]},{"nodeId":761230183,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1161189666,"text":"よかった。","nextNodeIds":[761230184]},{"nodeId":761230184,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3571206410,"text":"あと、これも。","nextNodeIds":[761230185]},{"nodeId":761230185,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3873724618,"text":"これは…風の翼？","nextNodeIds":[761230186]},{"nodeId":761230186,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2522533090,"text":"空には鳥が、大地には獣が…","nextNodeIds":[761230187]},{"nodeId":761230187,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1867390738,"text":"そして空と大地の間には、風の翼をつけた冒険者たちが駆け巡るって聞いたことがあるの。","nextNodeIds":[761230188]},{"nodeId":761230188,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1204773402,"text":"この翼と共に過ごす日々が、月明かりに照らされたように輝かしいものでありますように。","nextNodeIds":[761230189]},{"nodeId":761230189,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":173300338,"text":"すごく気に入った。ありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[761230190]},{"nodeId":761230190,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":4000355842,"text":"こちらこそ、付き合ってくれてありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":761230182,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3588016242,"text":"祈月の夜に食べたのよりおいしい。","nextNodeIds":[761230183]},{"nodeId":761230158,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3161452450,"text":"食べたいものがあれば、遠慮なく言って。","nextNodeIds":[761230159]},{"nodeId":761230144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2131488266,"text":"飲み込みが早いね。","nextNodeIds":[761230145]},{"nodeId":761230130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3197357162,"text":"味付けはもう少し工夫してもいいかも…","nextNodeIds":[761230131]},{"nodeId":761230124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1942978298,"text":"（大きく一口かじる。）","nextNodeIds":[761230125]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7612301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":[],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_ACTIVE_DAMSELETTE_FREE_MOON_PHASE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133603053","0"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7612301","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1318"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[